{"id":"n21134-1-8","stage":3,"title":"불가피하다 · 不可避免的","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21134-1-8-1","ko":"병원에서 꼭 수술을 해야만 한 대?","zh":"医院说一定得做手术吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원에서","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에서","audio":"/audio/84fefdb3373d75287aae.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"수술을","meaning":"手术","explanation":"수술：手术；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수술","audio":"/audio/aa0808e7565c5a89c0bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65022","senseId":"1","lemma":"수술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수술을","audio":"/audio/c97e71230bf236aa4c73.mp3"}},{"text":"해야만","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야만","audio":"/audio/22f5718ad1f11ab686e9.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"대?","meaning":"听说……吗","explanation":"这里与前面的 한 连起来理解为 한대?，相当于 한다고 해?，询问别人是否这样说。","readings":[{"term":"대","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"